  "prefLabel": "Rev 903.02 Mutual Fund Dividends",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 903.02 Mutual Fund Dividends. The automatic reinvestment of mutual fund dividends shall:\n\n(a) Not be considered a stock dividend; and\n\n(b) Be fully taxable in the year credited to the shareholder's account.\n\nSource. #4557, eff 12-28-88; ss by #5947, eff 12-29-94; ss by #6321, eff 8-22-96; ss by #8137, eff 8-10-04; ss by #10211, eff 10-24-12; ss by #13443, eff 8-12-22",
